# landmark (assets/world3d/pasture/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Flower Fields: the old oak towering over the north-west corner and the
# hay barn across the back with its loft door and cupola.
frustum  trunk   at 72 0 3 size 22 36 22 id pasture-oak-trunk
rock-4   rock    at 72 0 4 size 40 5 20 id pasture-oak-roots
blob-3   foliage at 72 30 0 size 80 36 44 id pasture-oak-crown
